## 2. 🗄️ PHÂN TÍCH THAY ĐỔI SCHEMA ([schema.ts](file:///d:/Code/project/glucare-api/src/database/schema.ts))

### 2.1. Cập nhật Bảng `users` 

**Hiện tại:**
```typescript
// Trường cũ cần thay thế:
isActive: boolean('is_active').default(true),
// THIẾU: deletedAt
```

**Thay đổi:**
```diff
+ // Thêm enum mới
+ export const userStatusEnum = pgEnum('user_status', ['PENDING', 'ACTIVE', 'BLOCKED']);

// Trong bảng users:
- isActive: boolean('is_active').default(true),
+ status: userStatusEnum('status').default('ACTIVE').notNull(),
+ deletedAt: timestamp('deleted_at'),
```

> [!WARNING]
> **Breaking Change:** Trường `isActive` (boolean) sẽ được thay thế bằng `status` (enum: PENDING/ACTIVE/BLOCKED). Cần cập nhật **TẤT CẢ** các file đang tham chiếu `isActive`:
> - [admin.repository.ts](file:///d:/Code/project/glucare-api/src/modules/admin/admin.repository.ts) (filter, verifyDoctor)
> - [admin.service.ts](file:///d:/Code/project/glucare-api/src/modules/admin/admin.service.ts) (updateUserStatus, verifyDoctor)
> - [admin.controller.ts](file:///d:/Code/project/glucare-api/src/modules/admin/admin.controller.ts)
> - [dto/update-user-status.dto.ts](file:///d:/Code/project/glucare-api/src/modules/admin/dto/update-user-status.dto.ts)
> - [dto/user-filter.dto.ts](file:///d:/Code/project/glucare-api/src/modules/admin/dto/user-filter.dto.ts)  
> - [seed.ts](file:///d:/Code/project/glucare-api/src/database/seed.ts) (thay `isActive: true` → `status: 'ACTIVE'`)
> - `auth` module (login check)

### 2.2. Bảng mới: `categories`

```typescript
export const categories = pgTable('categories', {
  id: uuid('id').defaultRandom().primaryKey(),
  name: text('name').notNull().unique(),
  description: text('description'),
  createdAt: timestamp('created_at').defaultNow().notNull(),
  updatedAt: timestamp('updated_at').defaultNow().notNull(),
  deletedAt: timestamp('deleted_at'),
});
```

### 2.3. Cập nhật Bảng `knowledge_articles` (E-12)

**Hiện tại (thiếu nhiều trường):**
```typescript
// CHỈ CÓ: id, title, content, category (text), thumbnailUrl, isPublished, createdAt
```

**Thay đổi:**
```diff
+ export const articleLanguageEnum = pgEnum('article_language', ['VI', 'EN']);

export const knowledgeArticles = pgTable('knowledge_articles', {
  id: uuid('id').defaultRandom().primaryKey(),
  title: text('title').notNull(),
  content: text('content').notNull(),
- category: text('category'),
+ categoryId: uuid('category_id').references(() => categories.id).notNull(),
  thumbnailUrl: text('thumbnail_url'),
- isPublished: boolean('is_published').default(false),
- createdAt: timestamp('created_at').defaultNow(),
+ language: articleLanguageEnum('language').notNull(),
+ isPublished: boolean('is_published').default(false).notNull(),
+ viewCount: integer('view_count').default(0).notNull(),
+ createdAt: timestamp('created_at').defaultNow().notNull(),
+ updatedAt: timestamp('updated_at').defaultNow().notNull(),
+ deletedAt: timestamp('deleted_at'),
});
```

### 2.4. Bảng mới: `system_configs`

```typescript
export const systemConfigKeyEnum = pgEnum('system_config_key', [
  'GLUCOSE_SAFE_MIN',
  'GLUCOSE_SAFE_MAX',
]);

export const systemConfigs = pgTable('system_configs', {
  key: systemConfigKeyEnum('key').primaryKey(),
  value: jsonb('value').notNull(),
  description: text('description'),
  updatedBy: uuid('updated_by').references(() => users.id),
  updatedAt: timestamp('updated_at').defaultNow().notNull(),
});
```

### 2.5. Bảng mới: `ai_usage_logs`

```typescript
export const aiFeatureEnum = pgEnum('ai_feature', ['VOICE', 'OCR']);
export const aiRequestStatusEnum = pgEnum('ai_request_status', ['SUCCESS', 'FAILED']);

export const aiUsageLogs = pgTable('ai_usage_logs', {
  id: uuid('id').defaultRandom().primaryKey(),
  userId: uuid('user_id').references(() => users.id).notNull(),
  feature: aiFeatureEnum('feature').notNull(),
  status: aiRequestStatusEnum('status').notNull(),
  errorMessage: text('error_message'),
  durationMs: integer('duration_ms'),
  createdAt: timestamp('created_at').defaultNow().notNull(),
});
```

### 2.6. Relations mới cần thêm

```typescript
// categories <-> knowledgeArticles
export const categoriesRelations = relations(categories, ({ many }) => ({
  articles: many(knowledgeArticles),
}));

export const knowledgeArticlesRelations = relations(knowledgeArticles, ({ one }) => ({
  category: one(categories, {
    fields: [knowledgeArticles.categoryId],
    references: [categories.id],
  }),
}));

// ai_usage_logs <-> users
export const aiUsageLogsRelations = relations(aiUsageLogs, ({ one }) => ({
  user: one(users, {
    fields: [aiUsageLogs.userId],
    references: [users.id],
  }),
}));
```

