## 4. 🔄 REFACTORING BẮT BUỘC

### Xóa hardcode ADA Standard trong Glucose Analytics

| File | Dòng | Hardcode | Thay bằng |
|------|------|----------|-----------|
| [glucose-analytics.service.ts](file:///d:/Code/project/glucare-api/src/modules/glucose/services/glucose-analytics.service.ts#L18) | 18, 20, 52, 53 | `70`, `180` | `systemConfigService.getConfigValue('GLUCOSE_SAFE_MIN/MAX')` |
| [glucose-dashboard.service.ts](file:///d:/Code/project/glucare-api/src/modules/glucose/services/glucose-dashboard.service.ts#L74-76) | 74-76 | `70`, `180`, `250` | `systemConfigService.getConfigValue(...)` |

> [!NOTE]
> Cần inject `SystemConfigService` vào `GlucoseModule`. Phương thức [calculateTIR](file:///d:/Code/project/glucare-api/src/modules/glucose/services/glucose-analytics.service.ts#6-34) và [determineStatus](file:///d:/Code/project/glucare-api/src/modules/glucose/services/glucose-analytics.service.ts#51-56) sẽ chuyển từ **synchronous** sang **asynchronous** (trả về `Promise`).

